    <description>This flow sends a Slack alert, either as a DM to the Case Owner if they have Slack User ID populated on their User record, or to the general #case-alerts Slack channel if the new Case owner does not have a Slack User ID.

9/20/2023 - VPP
Removed stopped criteria for Sam as he is now in Slack</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>Formula to shorten the Description field to 500 characters</description>
        <name>ShortDescriptionFormula</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>LEFT({!Get_Case.Description},500)</expression>
    </formulas>
