    <status>Active</status>
    <textTemplates>
        <description>Text template for Slack alert</description>
        <name>SlackTextTemplateChannel</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;!here&gt;

A case has just been transferred to {!Get_User_Case_Owner.Name}:

Customer: {!Get_Case.Account.Name}
Case Number: {!Get_Case.CaseNumber}
Case Subject: {!Get_Case.Subject}
Brief Description (first 500 characters): {!ShortDescriptionFormula}
Created Date: {!Get_Case.CreatedDate}
Case Link: {!$Label.sM_Salesforce_URL}/{!Get_Case.Id}


&lt;@U01V7S4ES8M&gt;: {!Get_User_Case_Owner.Name} does not have a Slack ID on their User record in Salesforce.  Please update so that this alert will be sent as a DM to the Case Owner instead of an alert to the entire channel.

--------------------</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>SlackTextTemplateDM</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;@{!varSlackUserID}&gt;


A case has just been transferred to you:

Customer: {!Get_Case.Account.Name}
Case Number: {!Get_Case.CaseNumber}
Case Subject: {!Get_Case.Subject}
Brief Description (first 500 characters): {!ShortDescriptionFormula}
Created Date: {!Get_Case.CreatedDate}
Case Link: {!$Label.sM_Salesforce_URL}/{!Get_Case.Id}

--------------------</text>
    </textTemplates>
